poe2ultra local integration (2026-10-05)
--------------------------------------
This modified version uses the name poe2ultra and new geometric book/U icons generated by
scripts/make-ultra-icons.py. It is based on upstream commit 5ad8bdb8923c4eccd5bb5e5c1d384e2d393c13b1.
Translation adapters, persistent cache and UI were added for Julian. The JavaScript modules in
src/lib/translation/vendor and data/poe2_terms.csv were supplied by Julian's local
poe2translator 1.7.0 project. context.js extracts its terminology workflow with cancellation propagation.
Version 1.4.0 also adapts that project's Chinese options HTML/CSS/JavaScript and selection
content/background scripts in src/entrypoints/options and src/lib/selection. The supplied original
source directory is unchanged; storage, message permissions and guide integration are adapted here.
Version 1.4.2 adds optional batch-debug hooks to the supplied API clients; requests and decoded
responses are recorded locally with credential redaction when guide debugging is enabled.
The terminology data retains source URLs and source-aligned quality markers; entries are not a claim
of manual review or endorsement by the game publisher. Upstream copyright and GPL terms remain intact.
